    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8198" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέλ-ιξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unfolding</i>: hence, <i>evolution</i> in dancing, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unfolding</i> in growth, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				632.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> logical
				<i>unfolding, exposition,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ -ξεις τῶν λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>in Prm.</u>
					p.542
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				97.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Prisc.Lyd.
				34.23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μαθηματικὴ ἐπιστήμη γνῶσίς ἐστι . .
					διεξόδοις τισὶ χρωμένη καὶ ἀνελίξεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Comm.Math.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
